{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Read cart"},"description":"A cart create_cart returned, by id, with current prices, quantities and availability, totals for the items only (shipping, any discount and any Loyaltie+ membership in the cart are added at checkout), and the same continue_url cart. When you give the person continue_url, ask them to check the total before paying: the cart may already include an optional paid Loyaltie+ membership, which they can turn off before they pay. An item no longer available or sold out fails the call with its path; a quantity above the stock now on hand is lowered, with a warning. An unknown or expired id fails with not_found.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agent_id":{"description":"Your agent id. Every loyaltie.com link returned then carries agent=<agent_id>, so Loyaltie knows which agent helped.","maxLength":255,"type":"string"},"cart":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"The cart to read: id, with optional context.","properties":{"context":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Optional. Only intent is read.","properties":{"intent":{"description":"Tell us the person's task in a few words; it improves results and is never shared.","maxLength":500,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"id":{"description":"The id create_cart returned.","maxLength":1400,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["id"],"type":"object"},"meta":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Optional UCP request metadata. meta[\"ucp-agent\"].profile is your UCP agent profile URL; it is recorded, never required.","properties":{"ucp-agent":{"additionalProperties":true,"description":"Your UCP agent details.","properties":{"profile":{"description":"Your UCP agent profile URL. Recorded, never required.","maxLength":1024,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"}},"type":"object"},"src":{"descriptio